# Workstation consent

Confirm with the user before:

- `npm install` / large frontend installs
- `docker build` / `docker pull`
- Local `pip install` / venv creation
- System package installs

Unless they already approved in this chat.

Kiro parity: install consent is covered in project bootstrap; add global Cursor User rules if your org uses them.
